{"id":"84fb6d5dede03600","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-simplegame.md","title":"Simple games and Boolean coalition encoding","display":"df-simplegame — Simple games and Boolean coalition encoding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-simplegame","aliases":["27-df-simplegame"],"display":"df-simplegame — Simple games and Boolean coalition encoding","depends_on":["[[27-df-vardom]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§1.1 Application 1.3; §1.13.3","source_printed_pages":"7,55,56","source_pdf_pages":"31,79,80","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-simplegame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-simplegame</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simplegame — Simple games and Boolean coalition encoding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.1 Application 1.3; §1.13.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"7,55,56"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"31,79,80"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 及布尔向量的坐标域见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b84ee77aaf0c828\" href=\"?note=4b84ee77aaf0c828\" title=\"27-df-vardom\">27-df-vardom</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]\">\\(N=[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(v:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq N\">\\(A\\subseteq N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(a)\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(a)\\)</span> 是下节构造的特征向量和支持集。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MonotoneGame}\">\\(\\mathrm{MonotoneGame}\\)</span> 是下节定义的谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in N\\setminus A\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq N),\\qquad\\operatorname{supp}(a)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in N\\mid a_i=1\\}\\quad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_A\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in N\\setminus A\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq N),\\qquad\\operatorname{supp}(a)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in N\\mid a_i=1\\}\\quad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_v(a)\\coloneqq v(\\operatorname{supp}(a))\\qquad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_v(a)\\coloneqq v(\\operatorname{supp}(a))\\qquad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Winning}(v)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq N\\mid v(A)=1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Losing}(v)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq N\\mid v(A)=0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Winning}(v)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq N\\mid v(A)=1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Losing}(v)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq N\\mid v(A)=0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MonotoneGame}(v)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall A,B\\subseteq N\\;(A\\subseteq B\\Rightarrow v(A)\\le v(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MonotoneGame}(v)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall A,B\\subseteq N\\;(A\\subseteq B\\Rightarrow v(A)\\le v(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书中初次定义简单博弈允许任意二值集合函数，应用部分再聚焦正函数所对应的单调投票规则；这里显式分开两者，避免偷偷要求单调或端点归一化。支持集与特征向量互为逆映射，故转换既不丢信息也不增加信息。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-vardom]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-vardom","status":"resolved","id":"4b84ee77aaf0c828","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[n]$ 及布尔向量的坐标域见 [[27-df-vardom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"N=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MonotoneGame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in N\\setminus A\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq N),\\qquad\\operatorname{supp}(a)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in N\\mid a_i=1\\}\\quad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).","display":true},{"tex":"f_v(a)\\coloneqq v(\\operatorname{supp}(a))\\qquad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Winning}(v)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq N\\mid v(A)=1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Losing}(v)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq N\\mid v(A)=0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MonotoneGame}(v)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall A,B\\subseteq N\\;(A\\subseteq B\\Rightarrow v(A)\\le v(B)).","display":true}],"bytes":2003,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-simplegame|df-simplegame — Simple games and Boolean coalition encoding]]"},{"id":"166289335b97f6e6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$N=[n]$，$v:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 且 $\\mathrm{MonotoneGame}(v)$，$f_v$ 见 [[27-df-simplegame]]。$\\mathrm{PI}$ 为素蕴涵项集，见 [[27-df-piset]]。对 $A\\subseteq N$，$C_A$ 是下节构造的正项函数，空积等于 $1$。"}],"outgoing":["4b84ee77aaf0c828"]}